{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img src=\"https://img.tvb.com/inews_admin/pro/20260511/entry_horizontal_6a0264ee0e378355ed7549c7_1778542855645_640x360.jpg\"><p>中國金茂上月的合同銷售額，按年增長逾兩成半。</p><p>按月跌逾百分之7，超過88億元人民幣。累計今年首四個月，合同銷售額逾312億元人民幣，增長逾兩成三。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-12T00:16:58.914192+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":73,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}